- id: P:program/split-a-folder
  type: program
  name: split-a-folder
  summary: A folder split in two, its Python and its prose, with the lines of its Python counted.
  why: a folder split in two, its Python and its prose, with the lines of its Python counted.
  must: []
  decided: []
  takes:
  - name: repo
    type: folder
  gives:
  - name: code
    type: folder
  - name: prose
    type: folder
  - name: size
    type: number
  lines: 3-16
  order: 1
  body: |
    program split-a-folder
      why: a folder split in two, its Python and its prose, with the lines of its Python counted.

      takes repo: folder
      gives code: folder, prose: folder, size: number

      let docs = repo where suffix is md
      for each d in docs where "Run" in d
        assert words d > 3          -- the page that says how to run it is more than a title
      end
      give code: repo where suffix is py
      give prose: docs
      give size: (repo where suffix is py).lines
    end
  steps:
  - P:step/split-a-folder.1
  - P:step/split-a-folder.2
  - P:step/split-a-folder.4
  - P:step/split-a-folder.5
  - P:step/split-a-folder.6
  provenance:
    mode: derived
    sources:
